  <section id="modin-pandas-timedeltaindex-seconds">
<h1>modin.pandas.TimedeltaIndex.seconds<a class="headerlink" href="#modin-pandas-timedeltaindex-seconds" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<dl class="py property">
<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="snowflake.snowpark.modin.pandas.TimedeltaIndex.seconds">
<em class="property"><span class="pre">property</span><span class="w"> </span></em><span class="sig-prename descclassname"><span class="pre">TimedeltaIndex.</span></span><span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">seconds</span></span><em class="property"><span class="p"><span class="pre">:</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference internal" href="snowflake.snowpark.modin.pandas.Index.html#snowflake.snowpark.modin.pandas.Index" title="snowflake.snowpark.modin.plugin.extensions.index.Index"><span class="pre">Index</span></a></em><a class="reference external" href="https://github.com/snowflakedb/snowpark-python/blob/v1.22.1/src/snowflake/snowpark/modin/plugin/extensions/timedelta_index.py#L197-L218"><span class="viewcode-link"><span class="pre">[source]</span></span></a><a class="headerlink" href="#snowflake.snowpark.modin.pandas.TimedeltaIndex.seconds" title="Permalink to this definition">¶</a></dt>
<dd><p>Number of seconds (&gt;= 0 and less than 1 day) for each element.</p>
<dl class="field-list simple">
<dt class="field-odd">Return type<span class="colon">:</span></dt>
<dd class="field-odd"><p>An Index with seconds component of the timedelta.</p>
</dd>
</dl>
<p class="rubric">Examples</p>
